d="uc4yxb_7" dir="ltr" data-container-id="main-col" data-xid="VpUvz" jsname="KFl8ub" class="mZJni" jsaction="cC6SSe:&amp;uc4yxb_7|mNzCb;" jscontroller="Aoijq#INwBm" data-sfc-root="c" data-ved="2ahUKEwijps2biPOXAxVZgP0HHblUL_oQ3KYQegYIAAgDEAE" data-processed="true"><div style="display: contents" data-container-id="7" data-processed="true"><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_p" data-hveid="CAAICRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><span style="display:none;" data-key="aimhl" data-value="" data-animation-skip="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="gHKH2d#QRKSy" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_q" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span data-subtree="aimfl" data-processed="true">Il modo più semplice, veloce e moderno per trasformare il sito web di Communico in un'applicazione è configurarlo come una </span><strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_r" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Progressive Web App (PWA)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<span jsuid="uc4yxb_s" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|9a313e1b-a674-4651-9130-0c195ec83d91-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;uc4yxb_s|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="c" data-wiz-uids="uc4yxb_u,uc4yxb_t,uc4yxb_v,uc4yxb_w" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="true" jsaction="click:&amp;uc4yxb_s|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf uc4yxb_s/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb uc4yxb_s/WyzG9e--><button jsuid="uc4yxb_t" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="9a313e1b-a674-4651-9130-0c195ec83d91" aria-label="Risultati correlati" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;uc4yxb_s|yrMC6;mouseenter:&amp;uc4yxb_s|w9rIQb;mouseleave:&amp;uc4yxb_s|SAMwlb" data-ved="2ahUKEwijps2biPOXAxVZgP0HHblUL_oQxcQVegYIAAgJEAE" data-hveid="CAAICRAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_x" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="uc4yxb_u" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwijps2biPOXAxVZgP0HHblUL_oQlZkRegYIAAgJEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf uc4yxb_s/lC1IR--><!--cqw1tb uc4yxb_s/lC1IR--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;9a313e1b-a674-4651-9130-0c195ec83d91&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_y" data-hveid="CAAIChAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">In questo modo, chiunque visiti il sito da smartphone (Android o iOS) vedrà apparire il tasto <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_z" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">"Aggiungi a schermata Home"<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, installando il sito proprio come se fosse un'app nativa, senza dover passare dagli store (Google Play o App Store).<span jsuid="uc4yxb_10" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|bfc359f4-690d-43ed-add6-6b8aea09d556-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;uc4yxb_10|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="c" data-wiz-uids="uc4yxb_12,uc4yxb_11,uc4yxb_13,uc4yxb_14" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="true" jsaction="click:&amp;uc4yxb_10|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf uc4yxb_10/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb uc4yxb_10/WyzG9e--><button jsuid="uc4yxb_11" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="bfc359f4-690d-43ed-add6-6b8aea09d556" aria-label="Risultati correlati" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;uc4yxb_10|yrMC6;mouseenter:&amp;uc4yxb_10|w9rIQb;mouseleave:&amp;uc4yxb_10|SAMwlb" data-ved="2ahUKEwijps2biPOXAxVZgP0HHblUL_oQxcQVegYIAAgKEAE" data-hveid="CAAIChAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_15" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="uc4yxb_12" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwijps2biPOXAxVZgP0HHblUL_oQlZkRegYIAAgKEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf uc4yxb_10/lC1IR--><!--cqw1tb uc4yxb_10/lC1IR--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;bfc359f4-690d-43ed-add6-6b8aea09d556&quot;,null,null,0,&quot;&quot;,&quot;&quot;,0,null,null,null,null,0,null,0]]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div><div class="n6owBd awi2gc" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="TDBkbc#Ml18Xb" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_16" data-hveid="CAAICxAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Per farlo, hai bisogno di aggiungere <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_17" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">due file principali<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> nella cartella principale (root) del tuo progetto su GitHub: un file <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_18" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">manifest.json<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> e un file <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_19" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">service-worker.js<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>.<span jsuid="uc4yxb_1a" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|7a291d39-dcc7-43b6-8023-6e5f4f32cd4e-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;uc4yxb_1a|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="c" data-wiz-uids="uc4yxb_1c,uc4yxb_1b,uc4yxb_1d,uc4yxb_1e" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="true" jsaction="click:&amp;uc4yxb_1a|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf uc4yxb_1a/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb uc4yxb_1a/WyzG9e--><button jsuid="uc4yxb_1b" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="7a291d39-dcc7-43b6-8023-6e5f4f32cd4e" aria-label="Risultati correlati" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;uc4yxb_1a|yrMC6;mouseenter:&amp;uc4yxb_1a|w9rIQb;mouseleave:&amp;uc4yxb_1a|SAMwlb" data-ved="2ahUKEwijps2biPOXAxVZgP0HHblUL_oQxcQVegYIAAgLEAE" data-hveid="CAAICxAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="uc4yxb_1f" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="uc4yxb_1c" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwijps2biPOXAxVZgP0HHblUL_oQlZkRegYIAAgLEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qkimaf uc4yxb_1a/lC1IR--><!--cqw1tb uc4yxb_1a/lC1IR--><!--TgQPHd|||[[&quot;7a291d39-dcc7-43b6-8