t="c" jsuid="ncGTjd_y" data-hveid="CAAICBAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Crea un nuovo file nella cartella principale del tuo progetto su GitHub (accanto a <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="ncGTjd_z" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">index.html<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> e <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="ncGTjd_10" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">manifest.json<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>), nominalo esattamente <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="ncGTjd_11" data-complete="true" data-processed="true"><code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="ncGTjd_12" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">service-worker.js<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> e incollaci dentro questo codice:<span jsuid="ncGTjd_13" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|8cbe797d-c799-4216-99d5-1c2d86e7bf83-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;ncGTjd_13|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="c" data-wiz-uids="ncGTjd_15,ncGTjd_14,ncGTjd_16,ncGTjd_17" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="true" jsaction="click:&amp;ncGTjd_13|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf ncGTjd_13/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb ncGTjd_13/WyzG9e--><button jsuid="ncGTjd_14" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="8cbe797d-c799-4216-99d5-1c2d86e7bf83" aria-label="Risultati correlati" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;ncGTjd_13|yrMC6;mouseenter:&amp;ncGTjd_13|w9rIQb;mouseleave:&amp;ncGTjd_13|SAMwlb" data-ved="2ahUKEwjNreTBiPOXAxW_gv0HHclPNl8QxcQVegYIAAgIEAE" data-hveid="CAAICBAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w