" jsuid="LKxbmc_1t" data-hveid="CAAIDRAA" data-complete="true" data-processed="true">Carica le due immagini nella cartella principale del tuo progetto (quella dove c'è l' <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="LKxbmc_1u" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">index.html<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>) e nominale esattamente così:<span jsuid="LKxbmc_1v" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|dc34a6a4-c1f5-4c8a-9dc6-e4bb35da4b3d-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;LKxbmc_1v|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="c" data-wiz-uids="LKxbmc_1x,LKxbmc_1w,LKxbmc_1y,LKxbmc_1z" data-complete="true" data-processed="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="true" jsaction="click:&amp;LKxbmc_1v|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf LKxbmc_1v/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb LKxbmc_1v/WyzG9e--><button jsuid="LKxbmc_1w" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="dc34a6a4-c1f5-4c8a-9dc6-e4bb35da4b3d" aria-label="Risultati correlati" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;LKxbmc_1v|yrMC6;mouseenter:&amp;LKxbmc_1v|w9rIQb;mouseleave:&amp;LKxbmc_1v|SAMwlb" data-ved="2ahUKEwj2kpTjifOXAxV22AIHHVIlFrIQxcQVegYIAAgNEAE" data-hveid="CAAIDRAB"><span class="pxxQye T6UJT"><div class="a14YJe"><svg class="EQxvpc MZhYme" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" aria-hidden="true" jsaction="" jscontroller="vODoFe#cKfyCe" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="LKxbmc_20" data-complete="true"><path d="M440-280H280q-83,0-141.5-58.5T80-480t58.5-141.5T280-680H440v80H280q-50,0-85,35t-35,85t35,85t85,35H440v80ZM320-440v-80H640v80H320ZM520-280v-80H680q50,0 85-35t35-85t-35-85t-85-35H520v-80H680q83,0 141.5,58.5T880-480T821.5-338.5T680-280H520Z"></path><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></svg></div></span><div jsuid="LKxbmc_1x" style="display: none;" data-ved="2ahUKEwj2kpTjifOXAxV22AIHHVIlFrIQlZkRegYIAAgNEAI"></div></button></span></span></span><!--qk