troller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="AOUxHe_1w" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">icon-192.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> e <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="AOUxHe_1x" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">icon-512.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>) nella schermata per caricarli nella cartella principale (insieme a <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="AOUxHe_1y" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">index.html<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="AOUxHe_1z" data-hveid="CAAIDxAD" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="AOUxHe_20" data-complete="true">Fai clic su <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="AOUxHe_21" data-complete="true">"Commit changes"<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> in fondo alla pagina per salvare.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span jsuid="AOUxHe_22" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|eae4ca52-1cbb-4728-9128-cf0352d9eb69-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;AOUxHe_22|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="c" data-wiz-uids="AOUxHe_24,AOUxHe_23,AOUxHe_25,AOUxHe_26" data-complete="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="true" jsaction="click:&amp;AOUxHe_22|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf AOUxHe_22/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb AOUxHe_22/WyzG9e--><button jsuid="AOUxHe_23" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="eae4ca52-1cbb-4728-9128-cf0352d9eb69" aria-label="Risultati correlati" class="vDOt8c" jsaction="click:&amp;AOUxHe_22|yrMC6;mouseenter:&amp;AOUxHe_22|w9rIQb;mouseleave:&amp;AOUxHe_22|SAMwlb" data-v