o link, ma non le copie create da altre persone.</div><div class="Pc83ge" wiz:wakeup="true"><span class="UAGvEc nBIMcd"></span><button tabindex="0" class="W4bPNd" data-ved="0CAYQ4LAQahgKEwiQ6aWUiPOXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQzQI" data-hveid="6"><svg fill="currentColor" width="14" height="11" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 14 11" display="none"><path d="M4.25012 8.12738L1.12262 4.99988L0.0576172 6.05738L4.25012 10.2499L13.2501 1.24988L12.1926 0.192383L4.25012 8.12738Z"></path></svg><svg fill="currentColor" width="24px" height="24px" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" display="block"><path d="M9 18C8.45 18 7.975 17.8083 7.575 17.425C7.19167 17.025 7 16.55 7 16V4C7 3.45 7.19167 2.98333 7.575 2.6C7.975 2.2 8.45 2 9 2H18C18.55 2 19.0167 2.2 19.4 2.6C19.8 2.98333 20 3.45 20 4V16C20 16.55 19.8 17.025 19.4 17.425C19.0167 17.8083 18.55 18 18 18H9ZM9 16H18V4H9V16ZM5 22C4.45 22 3.975 21.8083 3.575 21.425C3.19167 21.025 3 20.55 3 20V6H5V20H16V22H5ZM9 16V4V16Z"></path></svg><span class="mahiFd" aria-live="polite">Copia link</span></button><aside id="copy-failure-snackbar-id" popover="manual" jsaction="c4xGsd:.CLIENT;Z21mmf:.CLIENT" class="L9AUvd UL0w9b"><div class="o4t1Oc" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span class="MMvswb"><span class="OLCwg"></span></span><div class="RuJWR" style="display: none;"><div class="WACe9c">Al momento non è possibile copiare il link. Riprova più tardi.</div></div></div></aside></div><div class="XvJeCb"><div wiz:wakeup="true" class="QhaMdc v7ZVH"><button aria-label="Condividi con Facebook" class="lUfjxc" disabled="true" aria-disabled="true" data-ved="0CAcQ4bAQahgKEwiQ6aWUiPOXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQzQI" data-hveid="7"><svg version="1.1" id="svg9" width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 666.66668 666.66717" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs id="defs13"><clippath clipPathUnits="userSpaceOnUse" id="clipPath25"><path d="M 0,700 H 700 V 0 H 0 Z" id="path23"></path></clippath></defs><g id="g17" t