a-hveid="CAAICxAD" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="acnB5c_1n" data-complete="true">Trascina i due file (<code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="acnB5c_1o" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">icon-192.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code> e <code dir="ltr" class="KDcb0c" jsaction="" jscontroller="hNviFe#redMub" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="acnB5c_1p" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style="">icon-512.png<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></code>) con il mouse direttamente all'interno della pagina del browser.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class="Z1qcYe" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="oSLmPe#HokZ0d" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="acnB5c_1q" data-hveid="CAAICxAE" data-complete="true" data-sae="" style=""><span class="iNqyIf" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="KdQfFc#d5Qebf" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="acnB5c_1r" data-complete="true">In fondo alla pagina, clicca sul pulsante verde <strong class="rQesXe MPyX" data-sfc-cp="" jsaction="" jscontroller="tP2kf#s32ZS" data-sfc-root="c" jsuid="acnB5c_1s" data-complete="true">"Commit changes"<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> per salvare e pubblicare le icone.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span jsuid="acnB5c_1t" class="DHPVt Wg1cdb notranslate" data-suuid="nCd0md|2d9b2fed-bf14-4a83-bd66-ba332a49590c-|" jsaction="rcuQ6b:&amp;acnB5c_1t|npT2md" jscontroller="XqmSxe#JjQTXe" data-sfc-root="c" data-wiz-uids="acnB5c_1v,acnB5c_1u,acnB5c_1w,acnB5c_1x" data-complete="true" data-sfc-inited="2"><span class="NMq1me" data-animation-atomic="true" jsaction="click:&amp;acnB5c_1t|ZUljYd" data-sae="" style=""><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span><span class=""><span class=""><!--qkimaf acnB5c_1t/WyzG9e--><!--cqw1tb acnB5c_1t/WyzG9e--><button jsuid="acnB5c_1u" tabindex="0" data-amic="true" data-icl-uuid="2d9b2fed-bf14-4a83-bd66-ba332a49590c" aria-label="Risultati correlati" class="vDOt8c" 